{"schemaVersion":{"minor":3,"patch":0,"major":0},"identifier":{"url":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/defaultPosition(_:)","interfaceLanguage":"swift"},"kind":"symbol","hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow"]]},"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"tokens":[{"text":"@","kind":"attribute"},{"text":"MainActor","preciseIdentifier":"s:ScM","kind":"attribute"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"_","kind":"externalParam"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"position","kind":"internalParam"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Scene","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","kind":"typeIdentifier","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene"},{"text":"\n","kind":"text"}],"languages":["swift"],"platforms":["macOS"]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"kind":"parameters","parameters":[{"name":"position","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" that specifies where to place a"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"newly opened window relative to the screen bounds."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"kind":"content","content":[{"type":"heading","anchor":"return-value","level":2,"text":"Return Value"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that uses a default position for new windows."}]}]},{"content":[{"type":"heading","level":2,"text":"Discussion","anchor":"discussion"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The first time your app opens a window from a particular scene"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"declaration, the system places the window at the center of the screen by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"default. For scene types that support multiple simultaneous windows, the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system offsets each additional window by a small amount to avoid"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"completely obscuring existing windows."}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You can override the default placement of the first window by"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"applying a scene modifier that indicates where to place the window"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"relative to the screen bounds. For example, you can request that the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system place a new window in the bottom trailing corner of the screen:"}]},{"code":["@main","struct MyApp: App {","    var body: some Scene {","        WindowGroup {","            ContentView()","        }","        .defaultPosition(.bottomTrailing)","    }","}"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The system aligns the point in the window that corresponds to the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"specified "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" with the point in the screen that corresponds"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"to the same unit point."}],"type":"paragraph"},{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"You typically use one of the predefined unit points — like"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint\/bottomTrailing","isActive":true},{"type":"text","text":" in the above example — but"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"you can also use a custom unit point. For example, the following"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"modifier aligns the point that’s one quarter of the way from the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"leading edge of the window with the point that’s one quarter of"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"the way from the leading edge of the screen, while centering the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"window in the y-dimension:"}],"type":"paragraph"},{"code":["WindowGroup {","    ContentView()","}",".defaultPosition(UnitPoint(x: 0.25, y: 0.5))"],"type":"codeListing","syntax":null},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The modifier affects any scene type that creates windows in Windows,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"namely:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"unorderedList","items":[{"content":[{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","type":"reference"}]}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"code":"DocumentGroup","type":"codeVoice"}],"type":"paragraph"}]},{"content":[{"inlineContent":[{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings"}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"The value that you provide acts only as an initial default. During state"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"text":"restoration, the system restores the window to the position that it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"last occupied.","type":"text"}]}],"kind":"content"}],"sections":[],"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a default position for a window."}],"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/defaultposition(_:)"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"metadata":{"role":"symbol","symbolKind":"method","extendedModule":"OpenSwiftUI","externalID":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5ScenePAAE15defaultPositionyQrAA9UnitPointVF::SYNTHESIZED::s:11OpenSwiftUI13UtilityWindowV","title":"defaultPosition(_:)","fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"defaultPosition"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","text":"UnitPoint"},{"kind":"text","text":") -> "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"some"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP","text":"Scene"}],"modules":[{"name":"OpenSwiftUI"}],"roleHeading":"Instance Method"},"references":{"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI","role":"collection","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[],"title":"OpenSwiftUI","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Scene":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A part of an app’s user interface with a life cycle managed by the"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"system."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Scene","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Scene","title":"Scene","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"protocol","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"Scene"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/scene"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UnitPoint/bottomTrailing":{"fragments":[{"text":"static","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"kind":"keyword","text":"let"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"bottomTrailing"},{"kind":"text","text":": "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV","text":"UnitPoint"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"bottomTrailing","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/unitpoint\/bottomtrailing","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint\/bottomTrailing","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A point that’s in the bottom, trailing corner of a view."}],"role":"symbol"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"UtilityWindow","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A specialized window scene that provides secondary utility to the content"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"of the main scenes of an application."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UtilityWindow","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UtilityWindow/defaultPosition(_:)":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UtilityWindow\/defaultPosition(_:)","role":"symbol","type":"topic","kind":"symbol","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Sets a default position for a window."}],"title":"defaultPosition(_:)","fragments":[{"text":"func","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"defaultPosition","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"(","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI9UnitPointV"},{"text":") -> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"some","kind":"keyword"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"text":"Scene","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:11OpenSwiftUI5SceneP"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/utilitywindow\/defaultposition(_:)"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Settings":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents an interface for viewing and modifying an app’s"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"settings."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Settings","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Settings","title":"Settings","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Settings","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/settings"},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/UnitPoint":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"UnitPoint","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"UnitPoint","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/unitpoint","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/UnitPoint","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A normalized 2D point in a view’s coordinate space."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"UnitPoint","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/WindowGroup":{"fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}],"kind":"symbol","title":"WindowGroup","url":"\/documentation\/openswiftui\/windowgroup","type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/WindowGroup","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents a group of identically structured windows."}],"role":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WindowGroup","kind":"identifier"}]},"doc://OpenSwiftUI/documentation/OpenSwiftUI/Window":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"A scene that presents its content in a single, unique window."}],"kind":"symbol","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"Window","kind":"identifier"}],"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/OpenSwiftUI\/documentation\/OpenSwiftUI\/Window","title":"Window","role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Window","kind":"identifier"}],"url":"\/documentation\/openswi